    "pausa.mom.hums": "(She's humming the same six notes she always hums over the stove.)",
    "pausa.mom.rested": "There. Your Motes sound rested. Don't let Cade rush you up that route.",
    "pausa.sign.route1": "ROUTE 1 — Prelude Town ahead. Mind the resonance grass: it sings back.",
    "prelude.mart.welcome": "Welcome to the Prelude commissary! Bells, tonics, the lot.",
    "prelude.ona.after_badge": "A French Violin clef! At your age! My aunt would weep.",
    "prelude.ona.hall_hint": "Maestro Dario hangs the hall portraits at funny heights, doesn't he? Anyway — he favors the old crowd-pleasers.",
    "prelude.rest.done": "There. All voices back in tune. Do come again.",
    "prelude.rest.hum": "One moment — (she hums a falling third, then a resolved chord).",
    "region.cantorel": "Cantorel",
    "rival1.cade.defeat": "…recording that as a 'practice round'. Page forty.",
    "rival1.cade.intro": "There you are! Notebook says it's time for our FIRST official ranking match!",
    "rt1.busker.after": "The crowd went with you. Fair.",
    "rt1.busker.defeat": "Take the hat money, you earned it.",
    "rt1.busker.intro": "Spare a verse? No? Then a battle!",
    "rt1.choirboy.after": "Back to choir practice…",
    "rt1.choirboy.defeat": "My descant!",
    "rt1.choirboy.intro": "Solo audition. You're the audition.",
    "rt1.percussionist.after": "Off-beat. Me, I mean.",
    "rt1.percussionist.defeat": "You dropped my tempo!",
    "rt1.percussionist.intro": "Feel that beat? That's me. Two bars and you're done.",
    "rt1.tuner.after": "Hm. Perfectly tuned after all.",
    "rt1.tuner.defeat": "Sharp! Genuinely sharp.",
    "rt1.tuner.intro": "My fork says you're flat. Let's check!",
